      <p class="text-sm text-body dark:text-muted mt-2 max-w-lg">Don't rely on guesswork. Use our free, updated interactive calculators to estimate your corporate taxes, AOP slabs, and turnover liabilities instantly.</p>
    </div>
    <a href="/countries/pakistan/" class="relative z-10 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-primary px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-md transition-all hover:bg-primary/90 hover:shadow-lg hover:-translate-y-0.5 whitespace-nowrap">
